WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Listening for twelve minutes describes the session. It does not prove what changed.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In change-blindness research, people sometimes miss surprisingly obvious differences.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That is a reminder: an experience is not the same thing as a measured outcome.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 sells three distinct tiers, with different audio collections.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Research on general mindfulness cannot prove an effect for this exact product.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free exercise, read the underlying evidence, and decide without a miracle claim.
